========================================================================
  2. DATA SKETCHING — Compact similarity fingerprints
========================================================================

  Sketch sizes: 2128B each (TournamentSketch(rows=1600, chunks=100, size=2128B))
  vs raw data: 51200B per dataset
  Compression: 24x

